            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90582190?u=42818c7d5d2ee6aa051a66f1477789350f6a5863&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Updating CHIPS developer documentation since <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1931488\" rel=\"nofollow\">Firefox is shipping in 141</a>.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I'm updating the documentation to be factually accurate to represent some engineering work I did!</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1931488\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1931488</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3232525429\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27302\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27302/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27302\">mdn/browser-compat-data#27302</a></li>\n</ul>",
